  "description": "NCI-Profiler (NCIP) automatically detects and visualizes protein\u2013ligand non-covalent interactions: hydrogen bonds, hydrophobic contacts, salt bridges, \u03c0\u2013\u03c0 stacking, cation\u2013\u03c0, halogen bonds, metal coordination (with \u03c44/\u03c45 geometry analysis), water bridges and halogen\u2013water\u2013hydrogen (XWH) bridges. It takes PDB/mmCIF files or PDB IDs without manual preparation, handles multi-ligand and macrocyclic ligands, and produces editable 2D diagrams, an in-browser Mol* 3D view, PyMOL sessions and JSON/CSV/TXT output. Available as a free web server and a dependency-free Python CLI/API.",
  "editPermission": {
    "type": "private"
  },
